OL,3,GNEWSA'This is our lives', say under
OL,4,Athreat Pier Head traders
OL,5,
OL,6,FStreet traders who have operated two
OL,7,Fpitches on Liverpool's Pier Head for
OL,8,Fmore than 15 years have said they fear
OL,9,Fthey could lose their livelihoods under
OL,10,Fnew council plans.
OL,12,FPatsy Murphy and Harry Khanijau have
OL,13,Foperated a hot food stall and ice cream
OL,14,Fvan next to the Gerry Marsden Ferry
OL,15,FTerminal since 2009.
OL,17,FLiverpool City Council officials have
OL,18,Fproposed ending their permits from
OL,19,FApril next year because more tourist
OL,20,Fattractions and museums have been
OL,21,Fcreated in the area.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
